@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

title NDP: Neighbor Solicitation / Advertisement (echivalent ARP)

participant "Host A\nfe80::1" as A
participant "Rețea locală" as N
participant "Host B\nfe80::2" as B

A -> N : NS (multicast solicitat-node)\n"Cine are fe80::2? Eu sunt A, MAC aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff"
note right of N
  Destinație: ff02::1:ff00:2
  (solicited-node multicast)
  Nu broadcast ca în ARP
end note

N -> B : NS livrat doar către B
B -> A : NA (unicast)\n"Eu am fe80::2, MAC-ul meu e 11:22:33:44:55:66"

note right of A
  Cache vecini actualizat:
  fe80::2 -> 11:22:33:44:55:66
end note
@enduml